`StrictMono`, and `HasDistinctSums` over all order-connected index sets. -/
example (n : ℕ) : Erdos357.f n = sSup {k : ℕ | ∃ a : Fin k → ℤ,
    Set.range a ⊆ Set.Icc 1 n ∧ StrictMono a ∧ Erdos357.HasDistinctSums a} := rfl
